The only permitted purpose is using the software, without modification, for your own personal job search -- for example, searching for job postings, tracking your own applications, and preparing your own application materials. No other use is permitted, including but not limited to: use by or on behalf of a business, nonprofit, school, or government entity; use for any purpose other than your own personal job search; and use as part of, or in support of, any product or service offered to others. Any use beyond this permitted purpose requires the licensor's express prior written permission.

